  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaL &#x2013; Neithal Muttukadu and Basin Coordination Platform, India, 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this assignment is therefore to strengthen and operationalise the Neithal&#x2013;Muttukadu initiative by: 1. Updating and revalidating the detailed Concept Note and Report, reflecting recent environmental, institutional, and policy developments;2. Establishing a Basin-Wide Coordination Platform that aligns government, international, and local stakeholders around integrated, climate-resilient, and nature-based solutions (NbS) for the Kovalam&#x2013;Muttukadu basin.</narrative>
  </description>
